@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+This authored TrueType fixture contains six glyphs: .notdef, space, a 100-unit square, a quadratic arch, the square translated by (25,25), and a scaled square.
+Its Unicode map assigns space and A/B/C/D. The hhea range is 800 to -200 and each advance is 250 units.
+The composite has a zero horizontal bearing, which distinguishes raw native outline coordinates from FreeType's expanded bearing adjustment.
+Golden pixels come from the original Bedrock 1.26.60.5 cache raster instructions at heights 8 and 32.
